# Any MCP client
Streamable HTTP: https://127.0.0.1:8443/mcp

# for a client that can only run a command:
$MCPDEF bridge https://127.0.0.1:8443/mcp --ca $DIR/state/tls/ca.crt

The gateway's certificate is from its own CA: trust $DIR/state/tls/ca.crt.
  curl --cacert $DIR/state/tls/ca.crt https://127.0.0.1:8443/mcp
